    rdfs:label "bipinnate"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A pinnate quality inhering in a compound leaf by virtue of its primary divisions (pinnae) being themselves pinnate."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000410 (pinnate), added 2026-10-06 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: bipinnate (3)). Candidate for submission to PATO."@en ;
