obo:FLOPO_0991046 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "membranous"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A texture quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being thin, soft and flexible, like a membrane."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000150 (texture), added 2026-10-25 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: 2026-10-25 global-flora audit: 71 assertions referencing ID; includes context/alternative operands; 19 datasets). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-08: accepted as a reviewed FLOPO flora value; definition and PATO parent checked; 'chartaceous' removed as a related synonym (papery = PATO:0104010 papyraceous) 2026-11-14: definition reworded after the second-model review of the definitions (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
