obo:FLOPO_0991053 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "subglabrous"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A pilosity quality of a plant structure that is nearly glabrous, retaining only a few or very sparse hairs."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000066 (pilosity), added 2026-10-25 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: 2026-10-25 global-flora audit: 33 assertions referencing ID; includes context/alternative operands; 10 datasets). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-08: accepted as a reviewed FLOPO flora value; definition and PATO parent checked"@en ;
