obo:FLOPO_0991055 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "mucronulate"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A mucronate quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's apex ending abruptly in a minute mucro."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath FLOPO:0991054 (mucronate), added 2026-10-25 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: 2026-10-25 global-flora audit: 9 assertions referencing ID; includes context/alternative operands; 5 datasets). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-08: accepted as a reviewed FLOPO flora value; definition and PATO parent checked 2026-11-14: parent PATO:0000052 -> FLOPO:0991054; definition reworded after the second-model review of the definitions (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
