obo:FLOPO_0991057 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "lyrate"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A lobed quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being pinnately lobed or divided, with a large rounded terminal lobe and lateral lobes that become smaller towards the base."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0001979 (lobed), added 2026-10-25 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: 2026-10-25 global-flora audit: 6 assertions referencing ID; includes context/alternative operands; 2 datasets). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-08: accepted as a reviewed FLOPO flora value; definition and PATO parent checked 2026-11-14: parent PATO:0000052 -> PATO:0001979; definition reworded after the second-model review of the definitions (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
