obo:FLOPO_0991141 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "petaloid"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A morphology quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's resembling a petal in being thin, soft-textured and usually brightly coloured."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000051 (morphology), added 2026-11-13 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: petaloid/petal-like: 396 statements in 22 floras (staged candidates 2026-11-13)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-13: added in the flora candidate review, batch 1 (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). Sibling of PATO:0002459 sepal-like and PATO:0002457 leaf-like, worded as they are. 2026-11-14: parent PATO:0000052 -> PATO:0000051; definition reworded after the second-model review of the definitions (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
