obo:FLOPO_0991313 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "horn-shaped"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A 3-D shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being elongated, tapering to a point and usually curved, like an animal horn."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0002266 (3-D shape), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: horn shaped: 41 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). 2026-11-15: parent PATO:0002007 -> PATO:0002266; definition reworded after the review of the new classes (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
