obo:FLOPO_0991314 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "urticating"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A structural quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being a stiff hair with a brittle, easily broken tip that, on contact, breaks off and injects an irritant fluid into the skin."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000141 (structure), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: urticating: 40 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). 2026-11-15: definition reworded after the review of the new classes (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
