    rdfs:subClassOf obo:PATO_0000141 .

obo:FLOPO_0991315 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "coronate"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's bearing at its apex a crown, a short ring-like rim or circle of small teeth, scales or bristles, often formed by a persistent calyx limb or pappus."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000052 (shape), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: coronate: 39 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). 2026-11-15: definition reworded after the review of the new classes (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
