obo:FLOPO_0991318 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "semiovate"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A 2-D shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's outline being one half of an ovate figure divided lengthwise, with one side nearly straight and the other curved."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0002006 (2-D shape), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: semiovate: 39 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
