obo:FLOPO_0991320 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "unistratose"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An unstratified quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's consisting of a single layer of cells."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0002069 (unstratified), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: unistratose: 38 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). Mainly bryophyte laminae and margins; the opposite, bistratose or multistratose, falls under PATO:0002068 stratified."@en ;
