obo:FLOPO_0991321 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "pseudolateral"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A positional quality inhering in an inflorescence by virtue of its being terminal on the stem but appearing lateral because the lowest involucral bract continues the line of the stem beyond it."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000140 (position), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: pseudo lateral/pseudolateral: 38 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). Juncaceae, Cyperaceae."@en ;
