obo:FLOPO_0991322 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "bipinnatipartite"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A pinnatipartite quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's pinnately parted segments being themselves pinnately parted."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath FLOPO:0991156 (pinnatipartite), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: bipinnatipartite: 38 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
