obo:FLOPO_0991323 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "cladautoicous"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An autoicous quality inhering in a moss plant by virtue of its antheridia being borne on a separate short branch of the same plant that bears the archegonia."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath FLOPO:0991093 (autoicous), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: cladautoicous: 38 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
