obo:FLOPO_0991338 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "helicoid"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A coiled quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's successive branches arising always on the same side, so that the axis is coiled in a helix out of one plane."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000404 (coiled), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: helicoid: 31 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
