obo:FLOPO_0991339 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "catadromous"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A positional quality inhering in a division of a fern leaf by virtue of the first segment or vein of the division arising on its basiscopic side, towards the base of the axis that bears it."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000140 (position), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: catadromous: 31 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
