obo:FLOPO_0991341 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "interpetiolar"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A positional quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being inserted on the stem between the petioles of two opposite leaves."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000140 (position), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: interpetiolar: 30 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). Sibling of FLOPO:0991000 axillary; typically stipules of Rubiaceae."@en ;
