obo:FLOPO_0991342 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "gynodioecious"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A phenotypic sex quality inhering in a plant by virtue of its belonging to a species whose individuals bear either only female flowers or only bisexual flowers."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0001894 (phenotypic sex), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: gynodioecious: 30 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). Follows FLOPO:0991072 dioecious and FLOPO:0991094 andromonoecious."@en ;
