    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000141 (structure), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: monolete: 30 statements (second-model review 2026-11-14)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: proposed by the second-model review (Claude Opus) and checked (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). 2026-11-15: parent PATO:0000141 -> PATO:0000052 after the review of the new classes (Claude Opus; checked, AI review, Claude Fable 5.2)."@en ;
