obo:FLOPO_0991380 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "lateral (sensu botany)"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A positional quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's being located at a side of the structure that bears it, to the left or right of the median member of its series."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000140 (position), added 2026-11-14 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: stage qualifier of the flora transcriptions (upper 3,760, outer 3,359, lower 3,242, inner 3,169, middle 1,574, lateral 1,512 statements)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-14: position of a member of a series (flora context words 'upper leaves', 'inner tepals'); added for the context pattern 'state of the bearer' (docs/odp/04-state-of-the-bearer.md) after the second-model review found 20,000 statements held for want of the value (AI review, Claude Fable 5.2). PATO has the relational 'lateral to' and 'distal to' but no value for a member's place in its series."@en ;
